# Regression game input (tools/regress/hatari/drive.py format): times are
# seconds from the program start. Worked out in Hatari 2.4.1, plain ST,
# TOS 2.06, 4 MB, 22 Nov 2026; "mark play" is where gameplay was on screen.
start D:\JIMPOWER\START.TOS
seconds 125
shots 4
4 key 0x39        # gamex trainer menu: Space to continue
40 fire
45 fire
50 fire
55 fire
60 fire
65 fire
64 mark play      # level 1, banded pink sky: standing still until 85 s,
                  # then walking right - the trace covers both
85 joy1 right
105 joy1 -
